## Local Development Instructions

### Using Python
 1. cd to path of project
 2. In terminal enter, ```python -m http.server 8000```
 3. Open browser at http://localhost:8000


### Using Node.js
1. Ensure Node.js is install, if not do so by   
```npm install -g serve```
2. Start up the server by  
```serve .```


### Live Updates
```live-server --port=3000 --open=index.html```